    "text": "By Chase Parham ,\n1 days ago OXFORD | Approximately 950 square feet in a complex just off Old Taylor Road served as a ground zero of team bonding for Ole Miss baseball. If the Rebels develop the expected chemistry and follow up last season's upward trajectory, the lessons and impact of Winter Storm Fern deserve at least a footnote. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
